OCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Mundo Dos Cachos - Guia de Curvaturas e Cuidados</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #7b4397;
      --secondary: #dc2430;
      --bg-color: #faf6f0;
      --card-bg: #ffffff;
      --text-color: #2b2b2b;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg-color);
      color: var(--text-color);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 1rem;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 2rem auto;
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }

    .grid-section {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
    }

    .card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 220px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .card-content {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .card-content h2 {
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      background: #eee;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Universo Cacheado</h1>
    <p>Guia prático para valorizar a textura natural dos seus fios</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="grid-section">
      <article class="card">
        <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTOcalguX7p22wn6EcUoTWgEF9u7H31uMRcmRlDyQVorMbX-EX_M2WECCc&s=10" alt="Tabela de curvaturas de cabelos cacheados e crespos">
        <div class="card-content">
          <h2>Tipos de Curvatura</h2>
          <p>Entender a diferença entre os tipos 3A, 3B e 3C é essencial para escolher os produtos corretos e garantir a definição ideal dos fios.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTFgHHdr6-nPRp3u-VOj1YVCUIwhJqldmYco2S-845oHBYClna3Kr-ZwW5e&s=10" alt="Rotina de cuidados com cabelo cacheado">
        <div class="card-content">
          <h2>Rotina de Tratamento</h2>
          <p>Cabelos cacheados exigem nutrição e hidratação frequentes devido à dificuldade da oleosidade natural percorrer a extensão do fio em espiral.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Universo Cacheado - Projeto de Interface Web</p>
  </footer>

  <style>.like-btn {
  background-color: transparent;
  border: 2px solid var(--primary);
  color: var(--primary);
  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
  border-radius: 20px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin-top: 1rem;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
}

.like-btn:hover {
  background-color: var(--primary);
  color: white;
}

.like-btn.liked {
  background-color: var(--secondary);
  border-color: var(--secondary);
  color: white;
}</style>
</body>
<div class="card-content">,
    <button class="like-btn" onclick="toggleLike(this)">
  🧒  <span class="like-count">0</span> Curtidas
</button>
</body>
<script>
  function toggleLike(button) {
    const countSpan = button.querySelector('.like-count');
    let currentLikes = parseInt(countSpan.textContent);

    if (button.classList.contains('liked')) {
      button.classList.remove('liked');
      countSpan.textContent = currentLikes - 1;
    } else {
      button.classList.add('liked');
      countSpan.textContent = currentLikes + 1;
    }
  }
</script>
</html>